## Key Rules

- Do NOT propose separate pricing systems per industry. ONE system must handle all.
- Do NOT overwhelm the UI. Use progressive disclosure — start simple, reveal complexity only when toggled on.
- Do NOT break existing flat/distance_tiered/variable configurations. All changes must be backward compatible.
- DO make sure the AI agent can explain every quote component naturally in speech.
- DO make sure the Sample Quotes preview accurately reflects what the AI would say on a call.
- DO consider the interaction between: service call fee, base charge, per-unit charge, surcharges (price_modifiers), minimum charge, and service area limits.

